@startuml
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
title UC-14 - Register New Account

actor "Guest" as Actor
boundary "Auth / Profile UI" as FE
control "AuthController" as API
control "UsersService" as Service
database "MongoDB: users, role" as DB

Actor -> FE: Start UC-14
FE -> API: POST /auth/register
API -> Service: Execute Register New Account
Service -> DB: Read/write users, role
DB --> Service: Domain data
Service --> API: Result
API --> FE: Response
FE --> Actor: Tài khoản được tạo

alt Alternative / exception flow
  note over FE,Service: Username đã tồn tại -> Username already exists
  note over FE,Service: Email đã tồn tại -> Email already registered
end

note over Actor,DB
Pre: Chưa có tài khoản
Post: Tài khoản được tạo
Main flow:
1. User vào trang /register
2. User nhập: username, email, password, fullName
3. System validate: username unique, email unique, password strength
4. System hash password (bcrypt) và lưu user vào DB
5. System gửi email xác thực (nếu EMAIL_VERIFICATION_REQUIRED=true)
6. System redirect đến login hoặc auto-login
end note
@enduml
